Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.23,0:00:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so incompetent at sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nobita! Did you find the ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure to throughly check! We have but only that ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault for not catching it properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.05,0:00:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember! My mum told me she'd bake an exquisite french cake today just for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But you guys are welcome to eat with me.\NSo Wanna eat it with me, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, we're gonna eat cake at Suneo's house!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Cake! Yummy cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.74,0:00:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, you can look for the ball for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.99,0:00:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,However if you don't find it, I dunno how Giant would hit you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.62,0:01:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends left without me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.41,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling so sad...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.29,0:01:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm studying diligently. I'm so smart.
